        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Bangkok/_scene_tiger.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository df152624-1678-4688-ae63-4ddbfe21823d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Morning, 47. Your targets today are deadly duo Tarrin and Maelng. Masquerading as exterminators, they infiltrate buildings and then poison everyone inside so they can loot them. Although they are not using a poison. They are using an altered form of the Nabazov virus, which they keep in their truck under the watchful eye of Maelng. Today, they  are at the Himmopan Hotel, where musician Jordan Cross is staying. Exterminate the duo and destroy the virus, 47. I will leave you to prepare.",
